## R-9
Under the decided merge (A), no k, Lf (per-model table included) meets constraint 2 on LEAF-IR. This is R-9: the implementation stops and returns a Design Impact; no constraint is relaxed. The default model meets all three constraints with the decided values (IMP-20).
